Windows Registry Editor Version 5.00

; Example machine policy: forbid shutting down and signing out from the shell.
; Copy to 10-example.reg (drop the .example) to activate. sg-start dims and
; ignores the power and sign-out buttons; any Windows program that honours
; NoClose does the same.
[HKEY_LOCAL_MACHINE\Software\Microsoft\Windows\CurrentVersion\Policies\Explorer]
"NoClose"=dword:00000001
"StartMenuLogOff"=dword:00000001
